SUMMARY:MARLEY WILDTHING (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Chelsea
DESCRIPTION:Doors: 19:30\, Start: 20:00   "Happy birthday to me" // Marley Wildthing Album + Cabaret Marley Wildthing’s new album “Happy birthday to me" is ?nally coming out  and with it a big release concert celebrating queerness\, self-acceptance and Marley’s birthday! To warm up the night we will have performers in a Cabaret style show - look forward to burlesque\, drag\, comedy and more. Marley will play songs from her new Indie-Rock album with a special visual show on stage and supported by a band and special guests.  Allow yourself to come extra - dressed in all the colours of the rainbow\, as little as possible or whatever crazy piece you never dared to wear. There will be glitter to bedazzle you all who aren't shiny enough yet. Marley Wildthing is a queer artist from Lower Austria based in Vienna and Prague. The singer radiates a joy and optimism on stage that is transmitted to any audience. Marley writes songs about the environment\, (female) empowerment and self-acceptance. Her DIY music videos full of art and astounding visuals often show topics of nature and society. Marley Wildthing played festivals like the Viennese Donauinselfest (AT) and Colours of Ostrava (CZ)\,  won contests like the “Austrian Composers Award” and regularly tours through Europe and beyond. Video link:  https://youtu.be/DsDcHwunN84    www.marleywildthing.com www.facebook.com/marley.wildthing/  www.instagram.com/marleywildthing/  www.youtube.com/c/MarleyWildthing www.tiktok.com/@marley.wildthing
URL:https://www.chelsea.co.at/concerts.php#concert_6714
END:VEVENT
